    "description": "This makes a total of 6 servings of Shrimp &amp; Cauliflower Curry. Each serving comes out to be 324 calories, 20.9g fats, 5.5g net carbs, and 27.2g protein.",
    "datePublished": "2014-03-03T15:30:53+00:00",
